      "content": "idk, all those theories about multiverses or cycles just feel like distractions. even if there's more, the entropy part is still true for right here, right now. it feels like we're just fighting a battle that's already lost. like every bit of effort i put into my life, my work, my relationships... it's all just burning fuel for a fire that's eventually going to go out anyway. it feels so pointless to keep burning when you know there's nothing at the end.",
